   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="edition">
            <ab xml:lang="Grek grc">
               <pb n="convex" />
               <lb n="1" rend="left-to-right" /><persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#19250">Πκῦλις <surname>Προμπιούθης</surname></persName> καὶ <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#19260"><expan><abbr>Πετορζ</abbr><ex>μῆθις</ex></expan>
                  <lb n="2" rend="left-to-right" /><surname>Ἑρμίωνος</surname></persName> διὰ <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#19265">Ἀπολλωτᾶ</persName> καὶ <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#19245">Ἁτρῆ</persName>
               <lb n="3" rend="left-to-right" /><rs ref="ancient_titles.xml#id122" type="title"><expan><abbr>πράκ</abbr><ex>τορες</ex></expan></rs>
               <expan><abbr>σιτικ</abbr><ex>ῆς</ex></expan>
               <placeName ref="places.xml#8"><expan><abbr>Σοή</abbr><ex>νης</ex></expan></placeName>. <expan><abbr>ἐμέτρησ</abbr><ex>εν</ex></expan>
               <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#19270">Πε- <lb break="no" n="4" rend="left-to-right" />τορζμῆθις <surname><expan><abbr>Πετορζ</abbr><ex>μήθιος</ex></expan></surname>  τοῦ <surname>Βοὺκ</surname></persName>
               <lb n="5" rend="left-to-right" /><expan><abbr>ὑπ</abbr><ex>ὲρ</ex></expan>  μερισμοῦ <expan><abbr>ποι</abbr><ex>μένων?</ex></expan>  πυροῦ <expan><abbr>ἀρτάβ</abbr><ex>ας</ex></expan>
               <lb n="6" rend="left-to-right" />ἓξ (γίνονται) (πυροῦ) (ἀρτάβαι) ϛ <expan><abbr>λημ</abbr><ex>μάτων</ex></expan>  ιγ (ἔτους). <lb n="7" rend="left-to-right" /><date notAfter="+234-05-17" notBefore="+234-05-17" when-custom="Severus Alexander:13">(ἔτους) ιγ // Παχὼν κβ</date>. <lb n="8" rend="left-to-right" /><handShift cert="high" new="#m219245" />
               <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#19245">Ἁτρὴς</persName>
               <expan><abbr>σεσημεί</abbr><ex>ωμαι</ex></expan> . </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:lang="Latn en">
               <pb n="convex" /><lb n="1" rend="left-to-right" />Pkylis, son of Prompiouthes, and Petorzmethis,<lb n="2" rend="left-to-right" />son of Hermion, through Apollotas and Hatres, <lb n="3" rend="left-to-right" />collectors of wheat at Syene. Thus has measured <lb n="4" rend="left-to-right" />Petorzmethis, son of Petorzmethis, grandson of Bouk,<lb n="5" rend="left-to-right" />for the contribution of herdsmen (?) of wheat artabas<lb n="6" rend="left-to-right" />six, = 6 art. of wheat for the accounting of year 13.<lb n="7" rend="left-to-right" />Year 13, Pachon 22. <lb n="8" rend="left-to-right" />(hand 2) Hatres, I have signed. </ab>
         </div>
